      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The former Nabisco cookie factory on Fair Lawn Avenue once gave the area the nickname \"Cookie‑City\" for the scent of freshly baked cookies.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
